  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing the App Screens**\n\nI\'m now focused on the app\'s visual structure, planning the layout based on the provided images. My goal is to recreate each screen faithfully, hotlinking the image assets directly as specified in the instructions. I\'m prioritizing the efficient arrangement of elements and user interface components to match the reference images.\n\n\n**Analyzing Design Assets**\n\nI\'ve shifted my attention to the provided markdown and HTML. I\'m cross-referencing `Image_3_c366688f.markdown`, which defines the \"Cinematic Precision\" design system, with `Image_2_0f028922.html`, which contains the HTML structure and Tailwind styles. The color palette and specific layout details are clear, and I\'m ready to proceed with integrating this information to render the app\'s components.\n\n\n**Defining the Style Guide**\n\nI\'m now cataloging the color palette, typography, and other visual details gleaned from the provided information. I\'ve extracted primary, secondary, and tertiary colors, as well as several custom colors for backgrounds, dividers, and text elements, focusing on #7a85ff, #50d8e9, and #ffb689 as key reference points. I\'ve also identified Manrope and Inter as the primary typefaces, along with monospace for tabular numbers. I\'m noting the requested features to assist with navigation design.\n\n\n**Implementing Interactive Features**\n\nI\'m now focused on the interactive components, ensuring the landing page replicates the provided mockups precisely. I\'m prioritizing the implementation of live telemetry in the hero dashboard and interactive elements in sections like \"Operating rhythm, simplified\" and \"Turn signals into focus\". I am particularly focused on the dark palette and the interactive SVG graphs, hero dashboard, and control queue interactions.\n\n\n"
