  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Structuring the Application**\n\nI\'m now focusing on a modular application structure. I\'ve begun defining data models in `src/types/index.ts`. This includes models for Signals & Alerts, encompassing attributes like IDs, timestamps, system origins, messages, priority levels, statuses, tags, and metric values. I\'ve also outlined a model for Control Decisions.\n\n\n**Defining Data Models**\n\nI\'ve expanded the data models. I\'ve been thinking about the states for Control Decisions, adding `pending`, `reviewing`, and `executed`. I\'ve also detailed data models for Timeline Milestones, Operating Rhythm metrics, and Customer Case Studies. Furthermore, I\'ve outlined Pricing Tiers, and moved on to UI elements. I\'ve started building the header component in `src/components/Header.tsx`, focusing on matching the provided design.\n\n\n**Visualizing the Dashboard**\n\nI\'m now diving into the live dashboard view and its interactive elements. I\'m focusing on the smooth, real-time data streams that update every 1.5 seconds, specifically designing a scrubber/hover feature for detailed data insights. I\'m also planning the presentation of throughput, error rate, and sync status, including a pause/resume button and full-screen inspector trigger.\n\n\n**Designing UI Elements**\n\nI\'m now focusing on two key UI sections: Signal Intelligence and Decision Command. In `SignalIntelligenceSection.tsx`, I\'m crafting an analytical visualization with system hashes, signal density, a live feed/historical toggle, and interactive load testing. The `DecisionCommandSection.tsx` incorporates an interactive timeline scrubber spanning August to November, segmented by phases. I\'m focusing on \"turning signals into focus\" and \"guiding every decision forward\" in these components.\n\n\n**Constructing Operational Insights**\n\nI\'m now integrating operational telemetry into the dashboard, focusing on velocity, latency, and queue metrics. I\'m also working on an interactive Decision Logic schematic and a floating \"Control Queue\" card with actionable items, each with priority levels and relevant signals. This card includes \"Execute\" and \"Review\" buttons for control decisions, with state updates and modal triggers. Finally, I\'m building an `InsightsTimelineSection` with nodes representing Approval Cycles, Capacity Forecast, Risk Movement, and Operating Rhythm.\n\n\n**Integrating Customer Validation**\n\nI\'m now incorporating customer validation into the UI. I\'m building a `CustomerQuotesSection` with testimonials from Northline and Meridian, including a modal for full case studies. I\'ve designed a `FinalCTASection` with clear calls to action, and am constructing a matching `Footer` component. Lastly, I\'m working on the `LiveDashboardView`, focusing on the enterprise command dashboard with interactive live telemetry streams, signal filtering, and Control Queue management.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_5660"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"Append\":false, \"CodeContent\":\"export type NavSection = \'Platform\' | \'Dashboards\' | \'Customers\' | \'Pricing\' | \'Resources\' | \'Contact\';\\n\\nexport interface SignalItem {\\n  id: string;\\n  source: \'Linear\' | \'GitHub\' | \'Datadog\' | \'PagerDuty\' | \'Jira\' | \'Slack\';\\n  systemHash: string;\\n  timestamp: string;\\n  title: string;\\n  priority: \'High\' | \'Med\' | \'Low\';\\n  status: \'Nominal\' | \'Warning\' | \'Critical\';\\n  value: string;\\n  metric: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface ControlQueueItem {\\n  id: string;\\n  code: string;\\n  title: string;\\n  priority: \'High\' | \'Med\' | \'Low\';\\n  signalsCount: number;\\n  status: \'pending\' | \'reviewing\' | \'executed\';\\n  owner: string;\\n  impact: string;\\n  date: string;\\n  notes?: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface CaseStudy {\\n  id: \'northline\' | \'meridian\';\\n  author: string;\\n  role: string;\\n  company: string;\\n  quote: string;\\n  bgColor: string;\\n  textColor: string;\\n  teamSize: string;\\n  industry: string;\\n  keyMetric: string;\\n  keyMetricLabel: string;\\n  challenge: string;\\n  solution: string;\\n  results: string[];\\n}\\n\", \"Description\":\"TypeScript types for Romer command dashboard\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/types/index.ts\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating type definitions\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create types/index.ts\"}"
