  planner_response {
    response: "I have built the **Romer Command Dashboard** web application matching the provided design system, screenshot, and technical specifications.\n\n### Summary of Built Features:\n\n- **Exact Design System & Typography**: Implemented the *Cinematic Precision* theme with dark canvas palette (`#070708`, `#101112`, `#232426`), optical Manrope 520 typography, and tabular data telemetry.\n- **Header**: Fixed brand navigation with quick links to Platform, Dashboards, Customers, Pricing, Resources, Contact, and direct modals for *Log in* and *Start free*.\n- **Interactive Technical Hero Dashboard**:\n  - Live animated SVG telemetry threads with `P_OPTIMAL_SYNC` and `\316\224_MARGINAL_VAR` nodes.\n  - Interactive crosshair coordinate tracking and hover inspector tooltips.\n  - Real-time throughput (`124.9 GB/S`), core latency (`1.24ms`), and operational heartbeat status.\n  - Quick launcher to the live operating layer (`romer.app/overview`).\n- **Operating Rhythm Architecture**:\n  - **FIG 0.1 / UNIFIED VIEW**: Interactive layer inspector (`SEC_ALPHA`, `SEC_BETA`) with coordinate telemetry.\n  - **FIG 0.2 / DECISION GRAPH**: Concentric node network with hover lineage tracking.\n  - **FIG 0.3 / AUTOMATED RHYTHM**: Sine wave with real-time frequency selection (220Hz, 440Hz, 880Hz).\n- **Signal Intelligence**:\n  - Analytical visualization with interactive `P_SYNC_OK` and `\316\224_LATENCY_WARN` point inspection.\n  - Live Feed vs. Historical mode switcher and core load meter.\n- **Decision Command Center**:\n  - Interactive timeline scrubber spanning `AUG_24` through `NOV_24`.\n  - Operational metrics: Velocity (`14.28`), Latency (`4.2ms`), Queue (`09`).\n  - Interactive **Control Queue** with instant `Execute` actions and `Review` modals for `Q4_STRATEGIC_OKRS`, `HIRING_V4_SCALE`, and `INFRA_AUDIT_Q3`.\n- **Insights Timeline**: 4 linked operational nodes with expanded metric cards for *Approval cycles*, *Capacity forecast*, *Risk movement*, and *Operating rhythm*.\n- **Customer Evidence**: Direct interactive case study modals for Mara Chen (COO, Northline) and Ivo Patel (VP Operations, Meridian).\n- **Live Operating Layer (`Dashboards` Screen)**: Full operational workspace with multi-tab telemetry, filterable signal feeds, simulated inbound signal generator, and connected integration status (GitHub, Linear, Datadog, Slack, Jira).\n- **Interactive Global Modals**: Dedicated modal flows for *Schedule Briefing / Demo*, *Deploy Dedicated Workspace*, *SSO Authentication*, and *Decision Review*."
    thinking: "**Verifying Visual Fidelity**\n\nI\'m pleased to report that both the compilation and linting processes for the applet were successful. Now, I\'m verifying the final output. The goal is to confirm perfect visual consistency with the provided screenshot, the HTML rendering, and the intended design system specifications.\n\n\n**Analyzing Visual Details**\n\nI\'m now diving deep into the visual specifications. I\'ve noted the precise color values and font details. I\'m focusing on ensuring the typography, particularly the `Manrope` and `Inter` fonts, aligns perfectly with the design. The hero headline, interactive dashboard elements with real-time SVGs, and the three diagrams for simplified operating rhythm are under close scrutiny. I\'m also ensuring the interactivity is correctly rendered.\n\n\n"
