63\', elec: \'3.5 \303\227 10\342\201\273\342\201\267 \316\251\302\267m\', peakT: 680, routes: [\'Pressureless / Gas-Pressure Liquid Al Infiltration into Porous SiC Preform\', \'Powder Metallurgy Extrusion (25 vol% SiC Structural Grade)\'] },\n  { id: \'glare-fml\', name: \'GLARE 3 (Glass Laminate Aluminum Reinforced Epoxy)\', category: \'Composites\', tagLabel: \'Composite\', subtitle: \'Crack-bridging fiber-metal hybrid aerospace fuselage laminate\', formula: \'Al 2024-T3 Sheets (0.3mm) + S-2 Glass/Epoxy Prepreg Layers\', crystalStructure: \'3/2 Alternating Metal-Composite Layup\', standardCode: \'Airbus A380 Upper Shell Spec\', uts: \'717 MPa\', ys: \'360 MPa\', mod: \'58.0 GPa\', elong: \'4.5 %\', hard: \'120 HB (Outer Al)\', melt: \'Tg 135 \302\260C (Matrix)\', k: \'8.5 W/m\302\267K (Through-Thickness)\', cte: \'17.8 \302\265m/m\302\267K\', rho: \'2.52 g/cm\302\263\', elec: \'Conductive Outer Skins\', peakT: 125, routes: [\'Phosphoric Acid Anodizing (PAA) Al + Autoclave Co-Bonding (125 \302\260C, 0.6 MPa)\', \'Post-Cure Stretching (0.4% Plastic Strain) to Reverse Residual Stress\'] },\n  { id: \'cf-peek-tp\', name: \'CF/PEEK Thermoplastic Composite (AS4/APC-2)\', category: \'Composites\', tagLabel: \'Composite\', subtitle: \'Weldable high-toughness thermoplastic aerospace prepreg\', formula: \'61 vol% AS4 Carbon Fiber + PEEK Matrix\', crystalStructure: \'Semi-Crystalline PEEK Transcrystalline Interphase on CF\', standardCode: \'Solvay APC-2 / ASTM D3039\', uts: \'2130 MPa (0\302\260)\', ys: \'2080 MPa\', mod: \'138 GPa\', elong: \'1.45 %\', hard: \'90 Shore D\', melt: \'Tm 343 \302\260C (Tg 143 \302\260C)\', k: \'6.8 W/m\302\267K\', cte: \'0.28 \302\265m/m\302\267K (0\302\260)\', rho: \'1.60 g/cm\302\263\', elec: \'2.2 \303\227 10\342\201\273\342\201\265 \316\251\302\267m\', peakT: 390, routes: [\'In-Situ Laser-Assisted Automated Tape Placement (LATP @ 390 \302\260C)\', \'Thermoforming Stamp Consolidation + Induction Welding\', \'Autoclave High-Temp Consolidation (385 \302\260C)\'] },\n  { id: \'fr4-pcb\', name: \'FR-4 Woven E-Glass / Brominated Epoxy\', category: \'Composites\', tagLabel: \'Composite\', subtitle: \'Flame-retardant UL94-V0 printed circuit board substrate\', formula: \'7628 E-Glass Cloth + Tetrafunctional Epoxy (Tg 170 \302\260C)\', crystalStructure: \'8-Layer Orthotropic Woven Laminate\', standardCode: \'IPC-4101/126\', uts: \'340 MPa (Warp)\', ys: \'320 MPa\', mod: \'24.0 GPa\', elong: \'1.5 %\', hard: \'110 Rockwell M\', melt: \'Tg 170 \302\260C (Td 345 \302\260C)\', k: \'0.35 W/m\302\267K\', cte: \'13.0 \302\265m/m\302\267K (x-y) / 45 (z)\', rho: \'1.85 g/cm\302\263\', elec: \'Dk = 4.3, Df = 0.015 @ 1 GHz\', peakT: 195, routes: [\'B-Stage Treater Impregnation + Multi-Daylight Vacuum Hydraulic Press + Cu Foil Cladding\', \'UV Laser Microvia Drilling + Electroless Cu Metallization\'] },\n  { id: \'cermet-ticn-ni\', name: \'Ti(C,N)-NiMo Cermet\', category: \'Composites\', tagLabel: \'Composite\', subtitle: \'Core-rim hard ceramic-metal high-speed finishing insert\', formula: \'78 wt% Ti(C\342\202\200.\342\202\207N\342\202\200.\342\202\203) + 12% Mo\342\202\202C + 10% Ni-Co\', crystalStructure: \'FCC Carbonitride Core / (Ti,Mo)(C,N) Rim + Ni Binder\', standardCode: \'ISO P05 Finishing\', uts: \'1850 MPa (TRS)\', ys: \'4600 MPa (Compressive)\', mod: \'450 GPa\', elong: \'0.25 %\', hard: \'1750 HV\', melt: \'1450 \302\260C (Liquidus)\', k: \'32.0 W/m\302\267K\', cte: \'8.1 \302\265m/m\302\267K\', rho: \'6.65 g/cm\302\263\', elec: \'4.5 \303\227 10\342\201\273\342\201\267 \316\251\302\267m\', peakT: 1460, routes: [\'N2-Controlled Vacuum Liquid-Phase Sintering (1460 \302\260C)\', \'Sinter-HIP + PVD TiAlN Top Coat\'] },\n  { id: \'cu-w-80\', name: \'Copper-Tungsten W80Cu20 Pseudoalloy\', category: \'Composites\', tagLabel: \'Composite\', subtitle: \'Infiltrated refractory-metal thermal & arc-contact composite\', formula: \'80 wt% W Skeleton + 20 wt% Cu Infiltrant\', crystalStructure: \'Interpenetrating BCC W + FCC Cu Network\', standardCode: \'ASTM B702 Class D\', uts: \'620 MPa\', ys: \'540 MPa\', mod: \'290 GPa\', elong: \'2.5 %\', hard: \'230 HB\', melt: \'1083 \302\260C (Cu Phase)\', k: \'205 W/m\302\267K\', cte: \'8.3 \302\265m/m\302\267K\', rho: \'15.65 g/cm\302\263\', elec: \'3.2 \303\227 10\342\201\273\342\201\270 \316\251\302\267m (54% IACS)\', peakT: 1220, routes: [\'Porous W Skeleton Sintering + Capillary Liquid Cu Infiltration in H2 (1220 \302\260C)\', \'Spark Plasma Co-Sintering\'] },\n  { id: \'nomex-honeycomb\', name: \'Nomex Aramid Honeycomb Core Sandwich\', category: \'Composites\', tagLabel: \'Composite\', subtitle: \'Phenolic-dipped meta-aramid hexagonal cellular core\', formula: \'Poly(m-phenylene isophthalamide) Paper + Phenolic Resin\', crystalStructure: \'Hexagonal 3.2 mm Cell Core (48 kg/m\302\263)\', standardCode: \'BMS 8-124 / HRH-10\', uts: \'2.4 MPa (Flatwise Tensile)\', ys: \'2.35 MPa (Compressive Crush)\', mod: \'0.14 GPa (Core)\', elong: \'1.8 %\', hard: \'Cellular Core\', melt: \'Char > 370 \302\260C\', k: \'0.045 W/m\302\267K\', cte: \'25.0 \302\265m/m\302\267K\', rho: \'0.048 g/cm\302\263 (Core)\', elec: \'1.0 \303\227 10\302\271\342\201\264 \316\251\302\267m\', peakT: 180, routes: [\'Corrugation Block Expansion + Multi-Cycle Phenolic Dipping & Cure\', \'Film Adhesive Co-Cure with CFRP Face Sheets\'] },\n\n  // 8 Natural / Wood Materials (Total Natural = 8)\n  { id: \'white-oak\', name: \'Quercus Alba (Kiln-Dried White Oak)\', category: \'Natural / Wood\', tagLabel: \'Natural\', subtitle: \'Tyloses-occluded ring-porous hardwood composite\', formula: \'45% Cellulose \302\267 28% Hemicellulose \302\267 24% Lignin (12% MC)\', crystalStructure: \'Hierarchical Cellulose I\316\262 Microfibrils in Lignin Matrix\', standardCode: \'NDS Structural Hardwood\', uts: \'105 MPa (Parallel to Grain)\', ys: \'51 MPa (Compressive Parallel)\', mod: \'12.3 GPa\', elong: \'1.1 %\', hard: \'6040 N Janka\', melt: \'Pyrolysis > 260 \302\260C\', k: \'0.16 W/m\302\267K\', cte: \'4.9 \302\265m/m\302\267K (Longitudinal)\', rho: \'0.75 g/cm\302\263\', elec: \'3.0 \303\227 10\302\271\302\271 \316\251\302\267m (12% MC)\', peakT: 130, routes: [\'Controlled Humidity Kiln Drying (MC 12%) + Quartersawn Milling\', \'Steam Bending (100 \302\260C Saturated Steam) + Clamped Drying\', \'Thermo-Hydro-Mechanical (THM) Densification (130 \302\260C, 15 MPa)\'] },\n  { id: \'sitka-spruce\', name: \'Sitka Spruce (Aerospace Grade Picea Sitchensis)\', category: \'Natural / Wood\', tagLabel: \'Natural\', subtitle: \'High-specific-modulus straight-grain softwood\', formula: \'48% \316\261-Cellulose \302\267 27% Lignin \302\267 25% Hemicellulose\', crystalStructure: \'Aligned Tracheid Cellular Honeycomb\', standardCode: \'MIL-S-6073 Aircraft Spec\', uts: \'102 MPa (Parallel)\', ys: \'38.7 MPa (Compressive)\', mod: \'10.8 GPa\', elong: \'1.0 %\', hard: \'2270 N Janka\', melt: \'Pyrolysis > 250 \302\260C\', k: \'0.11 W/m\302\267K\', cte: \'3.8 \302\265m/m\302\267K\', rho: \'0.42 g/cm\302\263\', elec: \'5.0 \303\227 10\302\271\302\271 \316\251\302\267m\', peakT: 110, routes: [\'Rift-Sawn Defect-Free Selection + Equilibrium Conditioning\', \'Resorcinol-Formaldehyde Laminated Spar Pressing\', \'Acetylation Chemical Modification\'] },\n  { id: \'balsa-endgrain\', name: \'Balsa Wood (Ochroma Pyramidale End-Grain)\', category: \'Natural / Wood\', tagLabel: \'Natural\', subtitle: \'Ultralight closed-cell cellular wood core\', formula: \'Cellulose / Lignin Thin-Wall Ray Parenchyma\', crystalStructure: \'High-Aspect-Ratio Axial Vessel Tubes\', standardCode: \'Baltek SB.100\', uts: \'19.5 MPa (Longitudinal)\', ys: \'12.8 MPa (End-Grain Crush)\', mod: \'3.7 GPa\', elong: \'0.8 %\', hard: \'440 N Janka\', melt: \'Pyrolysis > 230 \302\260C\', k: \'0.055 W/m\302\267K\', cte: \'4.2 \302\265m/m\302\267K\', rho: \'0.15 g/cm\302\263\', elec: \'1.0 \303\227 10\302\271\302\262 \316\251\302\267m\', peakT: 160, routes: [\'Kiln Drying + End-Grain Block Slicing & Bonding (LNG Cryo Tank Core)\', \'Resin-Sealed Vacuum Infusion Sandwich Core\'] },\n  { id: \'moso-bamboo\', name: \'Engineered Moso Bamboo (Scrimber / LBL)\', category: \'Natural / Wood\', tagLabel: \'Natural\', subtitle: \'Functionally graded vascular-bundle sclerenchyma composite\', formula: \'Parenchyma Matrix + 40% Sclerenchyma Fiber Bundles\', crystalStructure: \'Graded Unidirectional Vascular Fiber Architecture\', standardCode: \'ASTM D5456\', uts: \'215 MPa (Densified)\', ys: \'92 MPa (Compressive)\', mod: \'16.5 GPa\', elong: \'1.4 %\', hard: \'7800 N Janka\', melt: \'Pyrolysis > 265 \302\260C\', k: \'0.21 W/m\302\267K\', cte: \'4.1 \302\265m/m\302\267K\', rho: \'0.88 g/cm\302\263\', elec: \'2.0 \303\227 10\302\271\302\271 \316\251\302\267m\', peakT: 150, routes: [\'Thermal Caramelization + Defibering + Hot-Press Phenolic Scrimber (150 \302\260C)\', \'Delignification + Hot-Pressed Densified Super-Bamboo\'] },\n  { id: \'natural-rubber-nr\', name: \'Vulcanized Natural Rubber (Cis-1,4-Polyisoprene)\', category: \'Natural / Wood\', tagLabel: \'Natural\', subtitle: \'Strain-crystallizing sulfur-crosslinked bio-elastomer\', formula: \'cis-1,4-(\342\200\223CH\342\202\202\342\200\223C(CH\342\202\203)=CH\342\200\223CH\342\202\202\342\200\223)\342\202\231 + S\342\202\223 + Carbon Black\', crystalStructure: \'Amorphous Entropic Network (Strain-Crystallizes >300%)\', standardCode: \'ASTM D2000 AA\', uts: \'28 MPa\', ys: \'3.2 MPa (100% Mod)\', mod: \'0.004 GPa\', elong: \'650 %\', hard: \'60 Shore A\', melt: \'Tg -72 \302\260C\', k: \'0.15 W/m\302\267K\', cte: \'220 \302\265m/m\302\267K\', rho: \'1.12 g/cm\302\263\', elec: \'1.0 \303\227 10\302\271\302\262 \316\251\302\267m\', peakT: 155, routes: [\'Hevea Latex Coagulation + Banbury Carbon-Black Mastication + Sulfur Vulcanization (155 \302\260C)\', \'Seismic Base-Isolator Lead-Core Lamination\'] },\n  { id: \'bombyx-silk\', name: \'regenerated Bombyx Mori Silk Fibroin\', category: \'Natural / Wood\', tagLabel: \'Natural\', subtitle: \'\316\262-sheet nanocrystal hierarchical protein biopolymer\', formula: \'(Gly-Ser-Gly-Ala-Gly-Ala)\342\202\231 Polypeptide\', crystalStructure: \'Antiparallel \316\262-Sheet Nanocrystals in Amorphous Matrix\', standardCode: \'USP Class VI Biomaterial\', uts: \'610 MPa (Fiber)\', ys: \'420 MPa\', mod: \'14.2 GPa\', elong: \'18.0 %\', hard: \'Biopolymer Fiber\', melt: \'Decomp > 280 \302\260C\', k: \'0.52 W/m\302\267K\', cte: \'18.0 \302\265m/m\302\267K\', rho: \'1.34 g/cm\302\263\', elec: \'1.0 \303\227 10\302\271\302\263 \316\251\302\267m\', peakT: 95, routes: [\'Na2CO3 Degumming + LiBr Aqueous Dissolution + Methanol \316\262-Sheet Crystallization\', \'Microfluidic Wet-Spinning Bio-Scaffold\'] },\n  { id: \'cork-suberin\', name: \'Quercus Suber Agglomerated Technical Cork\', category: \'Natural / Wood\', tagLabel: \'Natural\', subtitle: \'Zero-Poisson-ratio closed-cell suberin biopolymer foam\', formula: \'45% Suberin \302\267 27% Lignin \302\267 12% Polysaccharides\', crystalStructure: \'14-Sided Tetrakaidecahedral Corrugated Closed Cells\', standardCode: \'ESA TPS P50 Ablator\', uts: \'1.2 MPa\', ys: \'0.8 MPa (Elastic Buckling)\', mod: \'0.028 GPa\', elong: \'45.0 %\', hard: \'52 Shore A\', melt: \'Ablative Char > 350 \302\260C\', k: \'0.040 W/m\302\267K\', cte: \'40.0 \302\265m/m\302\267K\', rho: \'0.24 g/cm\302\263\', elec: \'1.0 \303\227 10\302\271\302\262 \316\251\302\267m\', peakT: 140, routes: [\'Steam Autoclave Expansion + Polyurethane/Phenolic Binder Molding (140 \302\260C)\', \'Spacecraft Re-Entry Phenolic-Impregnated Ablative Shielding\'] },\n  { id: \'nacre-biomimetic\', name: \'Biomimetic Nacre (Brick-and-Mortar Al2O3/Chitosan)\', category: \'Natural / Wood\', tagLabel: \'Natural\', subtitle: \'Freeze-cast platelet-interlocked bio-inspired ceramic\', formula: \'92 vol% Aragonite / Al\342\202\202O\342\202\203 Platelets + 8 vol% Biopolymer\', crystalStructure: \'Layered Bouligand / Brick-and-Mortar Architecture\', standardCode: \'Bio-Composite Gr