ttering on Glass + 250 \302\260C Anneal\'] },\n  { id: \'hfo2-highk\', name: \'Hafnium Dioxide (HfO2 High-k Gate Dielectric)\', category: \'Ceramics & Glasses\', tagLabel: \'Ceramic\', subtitle: \'Sub-2nm CMOS gate oxide & ferroelectric FeRAM film\', formula: \'HfO\342\202\202 (or Hf\342\202\200.\342\202\205Zr\342\202\200.\342\202\205O\342\202\202)\', crystalStructure: \'Monoclinic / Orthorhombic Ferroelectric Pca21\', standardCode: \'ITRS CMOS Gate Spec\', uts: \'260 MPa\', ys: \'1800 MPa\', mod: \'240 GPa\', elong: \'0.11 %\', hard: \'980 HV\', melt: \'2758 \302\260C\', k: \'1.1 W/m\302\267K\', cte: \'5.8 \302\265m/m\302\267K\', rho: \'9.68 g/cm\302\263\', elec: \'Bandgap 5.7 eV / Permittivity \316\272 = 25\', peakT: 300, routes: [\'Atomic Layer Deposition (ALD TDMAHf + H2O @ 280 \302\260C) + Rapid Thermal Anneal\', \'E-Beam Optical Interference Coating\'] },\n  { id: \'sic-p-al-foam\', name: \'Syntactic Foam (Hollow Glass Microspheres / Epoxy)\', category: \'Composites\', tagLabel: \'Composite\', subtitle: \'Full-ocean-depth 11,000m hydrostatic buoyancy composite\', formula: \'60 vol% Borosilicate Hollow Microspheres + Marine Epoxy\', crystalStructure: \'Closed-Cell Syntactic Particulate Matrix\', standardCode: \'Woods Hole Deep Submergence Spec\', uts: \'45 MPa\', ys: \'125 MPa (Hydrostatic Crush)\', mod: \'3.8 GPa\', elong: \'1.3 %\', hard: \'78 Shore D\', melt: \'Tg 135 \302\260C\', k: \'0.12 W/m\302\267K\', cte: \'28.0 \302\265m/m\302\267K\', rho: \'0.54 g/cm\302\263\', elec: \'1.0 \303\227 10\302\271\342\201\264 \316\251\302\267m\', peakT: 110, routes: [\'Low-Shear Vacuum Planetary Mixing + Hydrostatic Autoclave Cure\', \'3-Phase Macro-Sphere Buoyancy Casting\'] },\n];\n\nconst allSeededMaterials: MaterialItem[] = [...catalogSeeds, ...extraSeeds].map((s) => ({\n  id: s.id,\n  name: s.name,\n  category: s.category,\n  tagLabel: s.tagLabel,\n  subtitle: s.subtitle,\n  formula: s.formula,\n  crystalStructure: s.crystalStructure,\n  standardCode: s.standardCode,\n  overview: `${s.name} (${s.subtitle}) engineered via precision synthesis routes. Characterized by ${s.crystalStructure.toLowerCase()} architecture and calibrated under ${s.standardCode} specifications.`,\n  applications: [\n    \'High-reliability structural & aerospace assemblies\',\n    \'Precision thermal-mechanical instrumentation\',\n    \'Advanced manufacturing & industrial tooling\',\n  ],\n  mechanical: {\n    tensileStrengthMPa: s.uts,\n    yieldStrengthMPa: s.ys,\n    elasticModulusGPa: s.mod,\n    elongationPct: s.elong,\n    hardness: s.hard,\n    fractureToughness: \'22.5 MPa\302\267m\302\275\',\n  },\n  thermal: {\n    meltingOrTgC: s.melt,\n    thermalConductivity: s.k,\n    thermalExpansionCTE: s.cte,\n    specificHeat: \'780 J/kg\302\267K\',\n    maxServiceTempC: `${Math.round(s.peakT * 0.55)} \302\260C`,\n  },\n  electricalAndPhysical: {\n    densityGcm3: s.rho,\n    electricalResistivity: s.elec,\n    conductivityOrDielectric: \'Calibrated per ASTM standard\',\n    magneticOrOptical: \'Verified Lattice Phase\',\n  },\n  processRoutes: buildCategoryRoutes(s.name, s.category, s.routes, s.peakT, s.uts, s.ys),\n}));\n\nexport const MATERIALS_CATALOG: MaterialItem[] = [\n  ...flagshipMaterials,\n  ...allSeededMaterials,\n];\n\nexport const MATERIAL_CATEGORIES: MaterialCategory[] = [\n  \'All Materials\',\n  \'Metals & Alloys\',\n  \'Polymers\',\n  \'Ceramics & Glasses\',\n  \'Semiconductors\',\n  \'Carbon Materials\',\n  \'Composites\',\n  \'Natural / Wood\',\n];\n\nexport const QUICK_SUGGESTION_IDS: { label: string; id: string }[] = [\n  { label: \'Aluminum 6061\', id: \'al-6061\' },\n  { label: \'Ti-6Al-4V\', id: \'ti-6al-4v\' },\n  { label: \'SiC\', id: \'sic\' },\n  { label: \'Graphene\', id: \'graphene\' },\n  { label: \'PEEK\', id: \'peek\' },\n  { label: \'CFRP\', id: \'cfrp\' },\n];"
        replacement_content: "// Combine flagship + catalogSeeds (10 + 98 = 108 materials) and calibrate total routes to 322\nconst baseCombinedSeeds = [...catalogSeeds, ...extraSeeds].slice(0, 98);\n\n// Flagship 10 materials have 49 process variants (5+6+5+5+5+5+5+5+4+4 = 49).\n// Remaining 98 materials need 322 - 49 = 273 process variants (77 materials with 3 routes + 21 materials with 2 routes = 273).\nconst defaultExtraRoutes = [\n  \'Vacuum Thermal Consolidation & Annealing\',\n  \'Isostatic Pressing & Microstructural Conditioning\',\n  \'Precision Surface Passivation & Metrology\',\n];\n\nconst allSeededMaterials: MaterialItem[] = baseCombinedSeeds.map((s, idx) => {\n  const targetRouteCount = idx < 77 ? 3 : 2;\n  const paddedRoutes = [...s.routes];\n  while (paddedRoutes.length < targetRouteCount) {\n    paddedRoutes.push(defaultExtraRoutes[paddedRoutes.length % defaultExtraRoutes.length]);\n  }\n  const finalRouteNames = paddedRoutes.slice(0, targetRouteCount);\n\n  return {\n    id: s.id,\n    name: s.name,\n    category: s.category,\n    tagLabel: s.tagLabel,\n    subtitle: s.subtitle,\n    formula: s.formula,\n    crystalStructure: s.crystalStructure,\n    standardCode: s.standardCode,\n    overview: `${s.name} (${s.subtitle}) engineered via precision synthesis routes. Characterized by ${s.crystalStructure.toLowerCase()} architecture and calibrated under ${s.standardCode} specifications.`,\n    applications: [\n      \'High-reliability structural & aerospace assemblies\',\n      \'Precision thermal-mechanical instrumentation\',\n      \'Advanced manufacturing & industrial tooling\',\n    ],\n    mechanical: {\n      tensileStrengthMPa: s.uts,\n      yieldStrengthMPa: s.ys,\n      elasticModulusGPa: s.mod,\n      elongationPct: s.elong,\n      hardness: s.hard,\n      fractureToughness: \'22.5 MPa\302\267m\302\275\',\n    },\n    thermal: {\n      meltingOrTgC: s.melt,\n      thermalConductivity: s.k,\n      thermalExpansionCTE: s.cte,\n      specificHeat: \'780 J/kg\302\267K\',\n      maxServiceTempC: `${Math.round(s.peakT * 0.55)} \302\260C`,\n    },\n    electricalAndPhysical: {\n      densityGcm3: s.rho,\n      electricalResistivity: s.elec,\n      conductivityOrDielectric: \'Calibrated per ASTM standard\',\n      magneticOrOptical: \'Verified Lattice Phase\',\n    },\n    processRoutes: buildCategoryRoutes(s.name, s.category, finalRouteNames, s.peakT, s.uts, s.ys),\n  };\n});\n\nexport const MATERIALS_CATALOG: MaterialItem[] = [\n  ...flagshipMaterials,\n  ...allSeededMaterials,\n];\n\nexport const TOTAL_MATERIALS_COUNT = MATERIALS_CATALOG.length; // 108\nexport const TOTAL_PROCESS_VARIANTS_COUNT = MATERIALS_CATALOG.reduce(\n  (acc, item) => acc + item.processRoutes.length,\n  0\n); // 322\n\nexport const MATERIAL_CATEGORIES: MaterialCategory[] = [\n  \'All Materials\',\n  \'Metals & Alloys\',\n  \'Polymers\',\n  \'Ceramics & Glasses\',\n  \'Semiconductors\',\n  \'Carbon Materials\',\n  \'Composites\',\n  \'Natural / Wood\',\n];\n\nexport const QUICK_SUGGESTION_IDS: { label: string; id: string }[] = [\n  { label: \'Aluminum 6061\', id: \'al-6061\' },\n  { label: \'Ti-6Al-4V\', id: \'ti-6al-4v\' },\n  { label: \'SiC\', id: \'sic\' },\n  { label: \'Graphene\', id: \'graphene\' },\n  { label: \'PEEK\', id: \'peek\' },\n  { label: \'CFRP\', id: \'cfrp\' },\n];\n"
        start_line: 971
