    thinking: "**Developing New Interfaces**\n\nI\'m currently focused on developing two new interfaces. First, I\'m working on the Cinematic Precision Synthesis Command Overview, and second, on the Side-by-Side Material Comparison Modal/View. These features are designed to enhance the user\'s experience within the MatSci Navigator Workbench. I\'m aiming for seamless integration and intuitive design.\n\n\n**Visualizing Design Elements**\n\nI\'m now integrating the Cinematic Precision aesthetic from the provided examples into the specified screen. Specifically, I\'m focusing on incorporating elements such as the Hero Technical Dashboard and the interactive Synthesis Control Queue, ensuring the user interface remains intuitive and visually coherent, especially when scrolling to the Synthesis Architecture view, with its insights timeline and call to action.\n\n\n**Integrating Design Elements**\n\nI\'m now focusing on integrating the Cinematic Precision style into the main MatSci Navigator view. On the initial viewport (1440x900), the design is immediately visible, featuring the dark design system. As the user scrolls or navigates, the full telemetry and schematic sections become available, seamlessly integrated with the materials synthesis engine. I will examine the top bar contract next.\n\n\n**Defining Top Bar Contract**\n\nI\'m now nailing down the Top Bar Contract. It includes a wordmark, a few navigation links, and a primary action. Specifically, I\342\200\231ve defined the wordmark as \"MatSci Navigator\", navigation links as \"Navigator\", \"Telemetry\", \"Architecture\", \"Comparison\", and \"Specifications\", and the action as \"Compare Matrix (N)\" or \"Explore Ti-6Al-4V\". Following this, I am making sure the subtitle and stats counters from the image are visible at the top. I\'m also preparing to build the material comparison modal.\n\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_37680"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"Append\":false, \"CodeContent\":\"import React from \'react\';\\nimport { X, Trash2, Plus, ArrowRight } from \'lucide-react\';\\nimport { MATERIALS_CATALOG, MaterialItem } from \'../data/materialsData\';\\n\\ninterface MaterialCompareModalProps {\\n  isOpen: boolean;\\n  onClose: () => void;\\n  compareIds: string[];\\n  onToggleCompare: (id: string) => void;\\n  onClearCompare: () => void;\\n  onSelectMaterial: (id: string) => void;\\n}\\n\\nexport function MaterialCompareModal({\\n  isOpen,\\n  onClose,\\n  compareIds,\\n  onToggleCompare,\\n  onClearCompare,\\n  onSelectMaterial,\\n}: MaterialCompareModalProps) {\\n  if (!isOpen) return null;\\n\\n  const comparedMaterials: MaterialItem[] = compareIds\\n    .map((id) => MATERIALS_CATALOG.find((m) => m.id === id))\\n    .filter((m): m is MaterialItem => !!m);\\n\\n  const defaultSuggestions = [\'al-6061\', \'ti-6al-4v\', \'sic\', \'cfrp\'];\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div\\n      className=\\\"fixed inset-0 z-50 flex items-center justify-center p-4 bg-black/80 backdrop-blur-md\\\"\\n      onClick={onClose}\\n    >\\n      <div\\n        className=\\\"relative w-full max-w-6xl bg-[#0d0e0f] border border-[#232426] rounded-xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-2xl text-[#e5e2e3] inner-glow max-h-[90vh] overflow-y-auto\\\"\\n        onClick={(e) => e.stopPropagation()}\\n      >\\n        <div className=\\\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 pb-5 mb-6 border-b border-[#232426]\\\">\\n          <div>\\n            <h3 className=\\\"font-h3 text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-white\\\">\\n              Multi-Material Synthesis &amp; Property Matrix\\n            </h3>\\n            <p className=\\\"text-xs text-[#9A9DA3] mt-1\\\">\\n              Side-by-side comparison of creation parameters, mechanical strength, and thermal-electrical profiles\\n            </p>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-3\\\">\\n            {comparedMaterials.length > 0 && (\\n              <button\\n                onClick={onClearCompare}\\n                className=\\\"px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-mono-data text-[#ffb4ab] border border-[#ffb4ab]/30 rounded hover:bg-[#ffb4ab]/10 transition-colors flex items-center gap-1.5\\\"\\n              >\\n                <Trash2 className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n                <span>Clear All</span>\\n              </button>\\n            )}\\n            <button\\n              onClick={onClose}\\n              className=\\\"p-2 text-[#9A9DA3] hover:text-white border border-[#232426] rounded hover:bg-[#1a1b1d]\\\"\\n              aria-label=\\\"Close comparison matrix\\\"\\n            >\\n              <X className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n            </button>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {comparedMaterials.length === 0 ? (\\n          <div className=\\\"py-12 text-center space-y-5\\\">\\n            <p className=\\\"text-sm text-[#9A9DA3]\\\">\\n              No materials currently selected for side-by-side comparison.\\n            </p>\\n            <div className=\\\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-2\\\">\\n              {defaultSuggestions.map((id) => {\\n                const mat = MATERIALS_CATALOG.find((m) => m.id === id);\\n                if (!mat) return null;\\n                return (\\n                  <button\\n                    key={id}\\n                    onClick={() => onToggleCompare(id)}\\n                    className=\\\"px-3.5 py-2 bg-[#101112] border border-[#232426] hover:border-[#50d8e9] rounded text-xs text-[#50d8e9] font-mono-data flex items-center gap-1.5 transition-colors\\\"\\n                  >\\n                    <Plus className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n                    <span>Add {mat.name}</span>\\n                  </button>\\n                );\\n              })}\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        ) : (\\n          <div className=\\\"overflow-x-auto\\\">\\n            <table className=\\\"w-full text-left border-collapse text-xs\\\">\\n              <thead>\\n                <tr className=\\\"border-b border-[#232426]\\\">\\n                  <th className=\\\"py-3 px-4 font-mono-data text-[#9A9DA3] uppercase w-48\\\">\\n                    Parameter / Metric\\n                  </th>\\n                  {comparedMaterials.map((mat) => (\\n                    <th key={mat.id} className=\\\"py-3 px-4 min-w-[200px] bg-[#101112]/60\\\">\\n                      <div className=\\\"flex justify-between items-start gap-2\\\">\\n                        <div>\\n                          <div className=\\\"font-h4 text-sm font-bold text-white\\\">\\n                            {mat.name}\\n                          </div>\\n                          <div className=\\\"font-mono-data text-[10px] text-[#50d8e9] mt-0.5\\\">\\n                            {mat.category} \302\267 {mat.processRoutes.length} routes\\n                          </div>\\n                        </div>\\n                        <button\\n                          onClick={() => onToggleCompare(mat.id)}\\n                          className=\\\"text-[#9A9DA3] hover:text-white p-1\\\"\\n                          title=\\\"Remove from comparison\\\"\\n                        >\\n                          <X className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n                        </button>\\n                      </div>\\n                    </th>\\n                  ))}\\n                </tr>\\n              </thead>\\n              <tbody className=\\\"divide-y divide-[#1B1C1E] font-mono-data\\\">\\n                <tr>\\n                  <td className=\\\"py-3 px-4 text-[#9A9DA3]\\\">Formula / Composition</td>\\n                  {comparedMaterials.map((m) => (\\n                    <td key={m.id} className=\\\"py-3 px-4 text-[#bec2ff]\\\">\\n                      {m.formula}\\n                    </td>\\n                  ))}\\n                </tr>\\n                <tr>\\n                  <td className=\\\"py-3 px-4 text-[#9A9DA3]\\\">Crystal / Phase</td>\\n                  {comparedMaterials.map((m) => (\\n                    <td key={m.id} className=\\\"py-3 px-4 text-[#e5e2e3]\\\">\\n                      {m.crystalStructure}\\n                    </td>\\n                  ))}\\n                </tr>\\n                <tr>\\n                  <td className=\\\"py-3 px-4 text-[#9A9DA3]\\\">Primary Synthesis Peak T</td>\\n                  {comparedMaterials.map((m) => (\\n                    <td key={m.id} className=\\\"py-3 px-4 text-[#50d8e9] font-bold tabular-nums\\\">\\n                      {m.processRoutes[0]?.peakTempC} \302\260C ({m.processRoutes[0]?.shortName})\\n                    </td>\\n                  ))}\\n                </tr>\\n                <tr>\\n                  <td className=\\\"py-3 px-4 text-[#9A9DA3]\\\">Tensile Strength (UTS)</td>\\n                  {comparedMaterials.map((m) => (\\n                    <td key={m.id} className=\\\"py-3 px-4 text-white font-bold tabular-nums\\\">\\n                      {m.mechanical.tensileStrengthMPa}\\n                    </td>\\n                  ))}\\n                </tr>\\n                <tr>\\n                  <td className=\\\"py-3 px-4 text-[#9A9DA3]\\\">Yield Strength</td>\\n                  {comparedMaterials.map((m) => (\\n                    <td key={m.id} className=\\\"py-3 px-4 text-white tabular-nums\\\">\\n                      {m.mechanical.yieldStrengthMPa}\\n                    </td>\\n                  ))}\\n                </tr>\\n                <tr>\\n                  <td className=\\\"py-3 px-4 text-[#9A9DA3]\\\">Elastic Modulus (E)</td>\\n                  {comparedMaterials.map((m) => (\\n                    <td key={m.id} className=\\\"py-3 px-4 text-white tabular-nums\\\">\\n                      {m.mechanical.elasticModulusGPa}\\n                    </td>\\n                  ))}\\n                </tr>\\n                <tr>\\n                  <td className=\\\"py-3 px-4 text-[#9A9DA3]\\\">Elongation at Break</td>\\n                  {comparedMaterials.map((m) => (\\n                    <td key={m.id} className=\\\"py-3 px-4 text-white tabular-nums\\\">\\n                      {m.mechanical.elongationPct}\\n                    </td>\\n                  ))}\\n                </tr>\\n                <tr>\\n                  <td className=\\\"py-3 px-4 text-[#9A9DA3]\\\">Melting / Tg Point</td>\\n                  {comparedMaterials.map((m) => (\\n                    <td key={m.id} className=\\\"py-3 px-4 text-[#ffb689] tabular-nums\\\">\\n                      {m.thermal.meltingOrTgC}\\n                    </td>\\n                  ))}\\n                </tr>\\n                <tr>\\n                  <td className=\\\"py-3 px-4 text-[#9A9DA3]\\\">Thermal Conductivity</td>\\n                  {comparedMaterials.map((m) => (\\n                    <td key={m.id} className=\\\"py-3 px-4 text-white tabular-nums\\\">\\n                      {m.thermal.thermalConductivity}\\n                    </td>\\n                  ))}\\n                </tr>\\n                <tr>\\n                  <td className=\\\"py-3 px-4 text-[#9A9DA3]\\\">Bulk Density (\317\201)</td>\\n                  {comparedMaterials.map((m) => (\\n                    <td key={m.id} className=\\\"py-3 px-4 text-white tabular-nums\\\">\\n                      {m.electricalAndPhysical.densityGcm3}\\n                    </td>\\n                  ))}\\n                </tr>\\n                <tr>\\n                  <td className=\\\"py-3 px-4 text-[#9A9DA3]\\\">Electrical Resistivity</td>\\n                  {comparedMaterials.map((m) => (\\n                    <td key={m.id} className=\\\"py-3 px-4 text-[#bec2ff] tabular-nums\\\">\\n                      {m.electricalAndPhysical.electricalResistivity}\\n                    </td>\\n                  ))}\\n                </tr>\\n                <tr>\\n                  <td className=\\\"py-3 px-4 text-[#9A9DA3]\\\">Inspect Full Profile</td>\\n                  {comparedMaterials.map((m) => (\\n                    <td key={m.id} className=\\\"py-3 px-4\\\">\\n                      <button\\n                        onClick={() => {\\n                          onSelectMaterial(m.id);\\n                          onClose();\\n                        }}\\n                        className=\\\"text-xs text-[#50d8e9] hover:underline flex items-center gap-1\\\"\\n                      >\\n                        <span>Open in Workbench</span>\\n                        <ArrowRight className=\\\"w-3 h-3\\\" />\\n                      </button>\\n                    </td>\\n                  ))}\\n                </tr>\\n              </tbody>\\n            </table>\\n          </div>\\n        )}\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n}\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create side-by-side MaterialCompareModal component\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/MaterialCompareModal.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating MaterialCompareModal component\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create MaterialCompareModal.tsx\"}"
