  checkpoint {
    session_summary: "<summary>\n1. **Task Overview**\n   - **Core Request**:\n     - Turn 1: User provided `Image_1_529d9372.png` (Romer Command Dashboard landing page), `Image_2_0f028922.html` (HTML implementation), and `Image_3_c366688f.markdown` (the *Cinematic Precision* design system: `#070708` background, `#101112` panels, `#232426` hairline borders, `#50d8e9` cyan, `#5E6BFF` indigo, `#bec2ff` primary, `#ffb689` tertiary, `#E5FD17` lime, Manrope 520 headings, Inter + tabular monospace data, dot-pattern SVG schematics).\n     - Turn 2: User provided `/public/assets/aistudio/image_f48a1e5a.png` (**MatSci Navigator** \342\200\224 *\"Materials Synthesis Routes, Creation Parameters & Properties\"*) and requested: *\"Create this with respect to the above image\"*.\n   - **Success Criteria & Deliverables**:\n     - Build **MatSci Navigator** (\"Materials Synthesis Routes, Creation Parameters & Properties\") styled with the **Cinematic Precision** design system from the first turn.\n     - Include the exact features and data shown in `image_f48a1e5a.png`:\n       - Header with **MatSci Navigator**, subtitle `Materials Synthesis Routes, Creation Parameters & Properties`, and telemetry indicators (`108 Materials`, `322 Process Variants`, `\342\227\217 Local Java Engine`).\n       - Search bar with placeholder: `Search material by name, formula, or process (e.g., \'6061\', \'Ti-6Al-4V\', \'PLA\', \'Graphene\', \'CVD\', \'3D printing\')...`\n       - Category filter bar: `All Materials`, `Metals & Alloys`, `Polymers`, `Ceramics & Glasses`, `Semiconductors`, `Carbon Materials`, `Composites`, `Natural / Wood`.\n       - Split workbench layout:\n         - **Left column**: `108 materials (322 process variants)` | `Click any card to inspect creation parameters`, starting with the exact first 5 cards shown in the screenshot:\n           1. `Aluminum 1100` (`Metal`, `Aluminum alloy \302\267 5 process routes`: `Hot rolling / extrusion / forging`, `Hot rolling + cold rolling`, `Forging`, `+2 more`)\n           2. `Aluminum 6061` (`Metal`, `Aluminum alloy \302\267 6 process routes`: `Hot rolling / extrusion / forging`, `Hot rolling + cold rolling`, `Forging`, `+3 more`)\n           3. `Aluminum 7075` (`Metal`, `Aluminum alloy \302\267 5 process routes`: `Hot rolling / extrusion / forging`, `Hot rolling + cold rolling`, `Forging`, `+2 more`)\n           4. `Aluminum 2024` (`Metal`, `Aluminum alloy \302\267 5 process routes`: `Hot rolling / extrusion / forging`, `Hot rolling + cold rolling`, `Forging`, `+2 more`)\n           5. `Magnesium AZ31B` (`Metal`, `Magnesium alloy \302\267 5 process routes`: `Hot rolling / extrusion / forging`, `Hot rolling + cold rolling`, `Forging`, `+2 more`)\n         - **Right column**:\n           - Default / Explorer Prompt state matching `image_f48a1e5a.png`: Microscope icon, **Select a Material to Explore**, description text, and quick suggestions (`Aluminum 6061`, `Ti-6Al-4V`, `SiC`, `Graphene`, `PEEK`, `CFRP`), plus the 3 *Cinematic Precision* architectural figures (`FIG 0.1`, `FIG 0.2`, `FIG 0.3`).\n           - Selected Material Inspector state: Full synthesis route selector, interactive SVG thermal-time curve (`PHASE_01` to `PHASE_04`), step-by-step creation parameters (temperature, pressure, duration, atmosphere), and full Mechanical, Thermal, and Electrical/Physical property profiles.\n       - Below the workbench (and navigable from the top bar): The *Cinematic Precision* sections (`Turn synthesis parameters into focus`, `Guide every synthesis route forward` with interactive Synthesis Queue, 4-node Insights Timeline, `#D1EBEB` & `#C4FF44` engineering quotes, and Footer) + side-by-side Material Comparison modal.\n\n2. **Progress**\n   - **Skills & References Read**:\n     - `/skills/system_skills/frontend_design/SKILL.md`\n     - `/skills/system_skills/frontend_design/references/8_science_space_biotech.md`\n     - `/skills/system_skills/science/SKILL.md`\n   - **Completed Files**:\n     - `/src/index.css`: Configured Tailwind v4 `@theme` tokens and utilities (`.dot-pattern`, `.inner-glow`, `.font-h1`\342\200\223`.font-h4`, `.font-mono-data`).\n     - `/src/data/materialsData.ts`: Complete dataset of **108 materials** across all 7 categories and **322 process variants**, with flagship definitions for `Aluminum 1100`, `Aluminum 6061`, `Aluminum 7075`, `Aluminum 2024`, `Magnesium AZ31B`, `Ti-6Al-4V`, `SiC`, `Graphene`, `PEEK`, and `CFRP`.\n     - `/src/components/MatSciWorkbench.tsx`: Complete interactive split workbench with search, category filter buttons, 108 material cards, default \"Select a Material to Explore\" state with quick suggestions + `FIG 0.1 / 0.2 / 0.3` schematics, and detailed material + process variant inspector.\n     - `/src/components/MaterialCompareModal.tsx`: Side-by-side comparison modal across mechanical, thermal, electrical, and synthesis metrics.\n     - `/src/components/MatSciCommandSections.tsx`: *Cinematic Precision* command sections adapted for Materials Synthesis (`Turn synthesis parameters into focus`, `Guide every synthesis route forward`, 4-node Insights Timeline, and `#D1EBEB` / `#C4FF44` quote cards).\n   - **Pending Files to Update**:\n     - `/src/App.tsx` still points to the Turn 1 Romer components and needs to be updated to render the new **MatSci Navigator** experience (`MatSciWorkbench`, `MatSciCommandSections`, `MaterialCompareModal`, top 3-zone header, and footer).\n\n3. **Key Findings**\n   - The `MATERIALS_CATALOG` array in `/src/data/materialsData.ts` is calibrated so `TOTAL_MATERIALS_COUNT === 108` and `TOTAL_PROCESS_VARIANTS_COUNT === 322`.\n   - Following the `frontend-design` Top Bar Contract, `<header>` must have 3 clean zones separated by `gap-8` (1-line brand wordmark `MatSci Navigator`, 4 concise single-line nav links, and 1 primary action button), while the subtitle `Materials Synthesis Routes, Creation Parameters & Properties` and stats (`108 Materials \302\267 322 Process Variants \302\267 Local Java Engine`) sit immediately below in the workbench sub-header bar.\n\n4. **Errors & Fixes**\n   - In `/src/data/materialsData.ts`, fixed a typo (`interfaceSeedSpec` -> `interface SeedSpec`) and removed an unused reference to `extraSeeds` after slicing `catalogSeeds` to 98 items (10 flagship + 98 seeded = 108 materials). Not yet compiled after Turn 2 edits.\n\n5. **Active Context**\n   - Dev server is running on port 3000.\n   - `metadata.json` was already named in Turn 1 (`\"Romer - Command Dashboard\"`); per environment constraints, never rename `metadata.json` after the first turn.\n\n6. **Next Steps**\n   1. **Update `/src/App.tsx`**:\n      - Build a clean 3-zone `<header>` for **MatSci Navigator** (`MatSci Navigator` brand mark with Atom icon, nav links for `Navigator`, `Telemetry`, `Architecture`, `Comparison`, and primary CTA button `Compare Matrix` / `Inspect 6061`).\n      - Render `<MatSciWorkbench />` as the primary top experience, followed by `<MatSciCommandSections />`, a clean *Cinematic Precision* `<footer />`, and `<MaterialCompareModal />`.\n      - When a material is selected from `<MatSciCommandSections />` or `<MaterialCompareModal />`, select it in `<MatSciWorkbench />` and smoothly scroll to the workbench inspector.\n   2. **Verify Build & Types**:\n      - Run `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` to verify zero TypeScript or build errors.\n\n7. **Commitments & Constraints**\n   - Do not rename `metadata.json` (only set on first turn).\n   - Adhere to `frontend-design` rules: 3-zone Top Bar Contract, single-line controls (`whitespace-nowrap shrink-0`), tabular numerals (`tabular-nums`), and working handlers on every interactive element.\n</summary>"
