  planner_response {
    response: "I have created **MatSci Navigator** (*Materials Synthesis Routes, Creation Parameters & Properties*) styled with the **Cinematic Precision** design system from your first reference:\n\n- **Header & Telemetry Bar**: Features the **MatSci Navigator** brand mark, `108 Materials`, `322 Process Variants`, and `\342\227\217 Local Java Engine` indicators alongside the multi-material comparison matrix trigger.\n- **Search & Category Filtering**: Full-width search bar (`Search material by name, formula, or process (e.g., \'6061\', \'Ti-6Al-4V\', \'PLA\', \'Graphene\', \'CVD\', \'3D printing\')...`) paired with interactive filters for `All Materials`, `Metals & Alloys`, `Polymers`, `Ceramics & Glasses`, `Semiconductors`, `Carbon Materials`, `Composites`, and `Natural / Wood`.\n- **108-Material Catalog & Process Routes**: Left-hand scrollable catalog starting with `Aluminum 1100`, `Aluminum 6061`, `Aluminum 7075`, `Aluminum 2024`, and `Magnesium AZ31B`, showing process route counts (`5 process routes`, `6 process routes`), route tags (`Hot rolling / extrusion / forging`, `Hot rolling + cold rolling`, `Forging`, `+2 more` / `+3 more`), and direct route selection.\n- **Explorer Prompt & Full Synthesis Inspector**:\n  - **Default State**: Displays the **Select a Material to Explore** prompt with quick-suggestion buttons (`Aluminum 6061`, `Ti-6Al-4V`, `SiC`, `Graphene`, `PEEK`, `CFRP`) and the `FIG 0.1`, `FIG 0.2`, and `FIG 0.3` architectural schematics.\n  - **Selected Material State**: Interactive process-route tabs, live SVG thermal-time processing curve (`PHASE_01`\342\200\223`PHASE_04` with interactive cursor readout), step-by-step creation parameters (temperature, pressure, duration, atmosphere), and full **Mechanical**, **Thermal**, and **Electrical / Physical** property profiles."
